{"id":"wb-7-799","name":"三王村三嵕庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"三王村三嵕庙","text":"三王村三嵕（zōng）庙，位于山西省晋城市高平市米山镇三王村，供奉后羿。 \n1986年8月18日，三嵕庙公布为第二批山西省文物保护单位，编号2-101。\n2013年3月5日，三王村三嵕庙公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E7%8E%8B%E6%9D%91%E4%B8%89%E5%B5%95%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94398334,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94398334","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1b852db07c72aa23619e48c0.jpg","title":"20260828_Sanzong_Temple,_Sanwang_Village_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260828_Sanzong_Temple,_Sanwang_Village_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/15/20260828_Sanzong_Temple%2C_Sanwang_Village_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 山西高平 三王村三嵕庙","width":320,"height":213}}